                                 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/publisher> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Polytechnic_University_of_Turin>;
                                 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "Recommender System Context"@en;
                                 <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "rsctx";
                                 <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "http://softeng.polito.it/rsctx#";
                                 a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>;
                                 rdfs:comment "This ontology represent context which may be interesting in providing recommendations to users."@en;
                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://www.auto.tuwien.ac.at/downloads/thinkhome/ontology/WeatherOntology.owl>,
                                                                         <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl>,
